# No ontology at all: the loop does not run (the zero-solution case). Triples
# that look like metadata are there and must stay unread.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix sdo: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix doap: <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix vann: <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/onto#> .

ex:Thing a owl:Class ; dcterms:title "Not the ontology" ;
    dcterms:creator "Mallory" ; owl:imports <http://example.org/other#> .
